The PEACE audio encoder reimplements the AFx-Rep architecture from ST-ITO
(https://github.com/csteinmetz1/st-ito), whose CNN14 backbone derives from PANNs
(https://github.com/qiuqiangkong/audioset_tagging_cnn).

ST-ITO is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (attribution: Christian
J. Steinmetz). The license text is included in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. The
released PEACE weights train this architecture from scratch and do not contain
the pretrained AFx-Rep weights.

